{"surah":80,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"arabic":"عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","translit":"AAabasa watawalla","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"The Prophet frowned and turned away"}},{"n":2,"arabic":"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلۡأَعۡمَىٰ","translit":"An jaahu alaAAma","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting]"}},{"n":3,"arabic":"وَمَا يُدۡرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","translit":"Wama yudreeka laAAallahu yazzakka","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"But what would make you perceive, [O Muhammad], that perhaps he might be purified"}},{"n":4,"arabic":"أَوۡ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰٓ","translit":"Aw yaththakkaru fatanfaAAahu alththikra","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him"}},{"n":5,"arabic":"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰ","translit":"Amma mani istaghna","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"As for he who thinks himself without need"}},{"n":6,"arabic":"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","translit":"Faanta lahu tasadda","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"To him you give attention"}},{"n":7,"arabic":"وَمَا عَلَيۡكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","translit":"Wama AAalayka alla yazzakka","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified"}},{"n":8,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسۡعَىٰ","translit":"Waamma man jaaka yasAAa","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]"}},{"n":9,"arabic":"وَهُوَ يَخۡشَىٰ","translit":"Wahuwa yakhsha","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"While he fears [Allah]"}},{"n":10,"arabic":"فَأَنتَ عَنۡهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","translit":"Faanta AAanhu talahha","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"From him you are distracted"}},{"n":11,"arabic":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذۡكِرَةࣱ‏","translit":"Kalla innaha tathkiratun","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"No! Indeed, these verses are a reminder"}},{"n":12,"arabic":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","translit":"Faman shaa thakarahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"So whoever wills may remember it"}},{"n":13,"arabic":"فِي صُحُفࣲ مُّكَرَّمَةࣲ‏","translit":"Fee suhufin mukarramatin","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"[It is recorded] in honored sheets"}},{"n":14,"arabic":"مَّرۡفُوعَةࣲ مُّطَهَّرَةِۭ","translit":"MarfooAAatin mutahharatin","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Exalted and purified"}},{"n":15,"arabic":"بِأَيۡدِي سَفَرَةࣲ‏","translit":"Biaydee safaratin","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels"}},{"n":16,"arabic":"كِرَامِۭ بَرَرَةࣲ‏","translit":"Kiramin bararatin","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Noble and dutiful"}},{"n":17,"arabic":"قُتِلَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكۡفَرَهُۥ","translit":"Qutila alinsanu ma akfarahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Cursed is man; how disbelieving is he"}},{"n":18,"arabic":"مِنۡ أَيِّ شَيۡءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","translit":"Min ayyi shayin khalaqahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"From what substance did He create him"}},{"n":19,"arabic":"مِن نُّطۡفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","translit":"Min nutfatin khalaqahu faqaddarahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him"}},{"n":20,"arabic":"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","translit":"Thumma alssabeela yassarahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then He eased the way for him"}},{"n":21,"arabic":"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقۡبَرَهُۥ","translit":"Thumma amatahu faaqbarahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him"}},{"n":22,"arabic":"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","translit":"Thumma itha shaa ansharahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then when He wills, He will resurrect him"}},{"n":23,"arabic":"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقۡضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","translit":"Kalla lamma yaqdi ma amarahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"No! Man has not yet accomplished what He commanded him"}},{"n":24,"arabic":"فَلۡيَنظُرِ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","translit":"Falyanthuri alinsanu ila taAAamihi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then let mankind look at his food"}},{"n":25,"arabic":"أَنَّا صَبَبۡنَا ٱلۡمَآءَ صَبࣰّ ا","translit":"Anna sababna almaa sabban","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"How We poured down water in torrents"}},{"n":26,"arabic":"ثُمَّ شَقَقۡنَا ٱلۡأَرۡضَ شَقࣰّ ا","translit":"Thumma shaqaqna alarda shaqqan","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts]"}},{"n":27,"arabic":"فَأَنۢبَتۡنَا فِيهَا حَبࣰّ ا","translit":"Faanbatna feeha habban","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And caused to grow within it grain"}},{"n":28,"arabic":"وَعِنَبࣰ ا وَقَضۡبࣰ ا","translit":"WaAAinaban waqadban","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And grapes and herbage"}},{"n":29,"arabic":"وَزَيۡتُونࣰ ا وَنَخۡلࣰ ا","translit":"Wazaytoonan wanakhlan","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And olive and palm trees"}},{"n":30,"arabic":"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلۡبࣰ ا","translit":"Wahadaiqa ghulban","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And gardens of dense shrubbery"}},{"n":31,"arabic":"وَفَٰكِهَةࣰ وَأَبࣰّ ا","translit":"Wafakihatan waabban","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And fruit and grass"}},{"n":32,"arabic":"مَّتَٰعࣰ ا لَّكُمۡ وَلِأَنۡعَٰمِكُمۡ","translit":"MataAAan lakum walianAAamikum","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"[As] enjoyment for you and your grazing livestock"}},{"n":33,"arabic":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","translit":"Faitha jaati alssakhkhatu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"But when there comes the Deafening Blast"}},{"n":34,"arabic":"يَوۡمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلۡمَرۡءُ مِنۡ أَخِيهِ","translit":"Yawma yafirru almaro min akheehi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"On the Day a man will flee from his brother"}},{"n":35,"arabic":"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","translit":"Waommihi waabeehi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And his mother and his father"}},{"n":36,"arabic":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","translit":"Wasahibatihi wabaneehi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And his wife and his children"}},{"n":37,"arabic":"لِكُلِّ ٱمۡرِيࣲٕ مِّنۡهُمۡ يَوۡمَئِذࣲ شَأۡنࣱ يُغۡنِيهِ","translit":"Likulli imriin minhum yawmaithin shanun yughneehi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him"}},{"n":38,"arabic":"وُجُوهࣱ يَوۡمَئِذࣲ مُّسۡفِرَةࣱ‏","translit":"Wujoohun yawmaithin musfiratun","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright"}},{"n":39,"arabic":"ضَاحِكَةࣱ مُّسۡتَبۡشِرَةࣱ‏","translit":"Dahikatun mustabshiratun","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Laughing, rejoicing at good news"}},{"n":40,"arabic":"وَوُجُوهࣱ يَوۡمَئِذٍ عَلَيۡهَا غَبَرَةࣱ‏","translit":"Wawujoohun yawmaithin AAalayha ghabaratun","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust"}},{"n":41,"arabic":"تَرۡهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","translit":"Tarhaquha qataratun","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Blackness will cover them"}},{"n":42,"arabic":"أُوْلَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلۡكَفَرَةُ ٱلۡفَجَرَةُ","translit":"Olaika humu alkafaratu alfajaratu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones"}}]}